Type: Package
Package: dryR
Title: Differential RhythmicitY analysis
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Cedric Gobet and Benjamin Weger
Maintainer: The package maintainer <cedric.gobet@epfl.ch>
Description: DryR ( Differential RhythmicitY analysis in R) is a
    statistical framework based on model selection that is designed to
    detect and estimate changes in rhythmic parameters (amplitude and
    phase) and mean expression in multiple conditions.
